{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51199","headline":"五言白话诗 六 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"用钱索新妇，当家有新故。\n儿替阿耶来，新妇替家母。\n替人既倒来，（「倒」，斯五六四一卷作「到」。\n）条录相分付。\n新妇知家事，儿郎永门户。\n（「永」，斯五六四一卷作「丞」，张锡厚改作「承」）好衣我须着，好食入我肚。\n我老妻亦老，替代不得住。\n语你夫妻道，我死还到汝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}